aka the coastal area is known as \"Parashurama Kshetra\"", "timestamp": 1794255644, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "chandureddy.in", "author_id": "56691505413", "id": "18105584579156677", "text": "because  prabhu parasuram mother has cried and screamed parashurama  name  in pain  21 times by seeing her husband getting killed 😢", "timestamp": 1794099570, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_vikiz", "author_id": "54894942100", "id": "17957575785275418", "text": "Why no audio 😢", "timestamp": 1794039792, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "agrima112024", "author_id": "63306487516", "id": "18125056097018380", "text": "I didn't understand?", "timestamp": 1793973724, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "duuuuude_335", "author_id": "46291291453", "id": "17898440838420805", "text": "Why you skipped Renuka?", "timestamp": 1793970880, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ak5hitkaushik", "author_id": "55069990201", "id": "17916023007551293", "text": "This video is a bit inaccurate. Just like the one which said that shastra arjun had 1000 arms . First of Rishi jamdagini was not killed by sons of sahastra Arjun  he was killed by shastra arjun himself and Rishi did not go down without a fight he took up is sword and fought him and even said that Ram was correct in saying that sometimes brahmins need to draw weapons. Then lord Parshuram killed each and every alive of sahastra Arjun and his sons and sahastra arjun himself . And about the 21 you know times he fought the kshtriya he did not declared 21 wars to win the earth instead to avenge his father he killed specifically haihaiya kshtriya and other kshtriya who were unrighteous and adhrmi sparring the righteous ones. And yes he did with the lakes in kurukshetra with blood. My sources ?? Vishnu Puran.", "timestamp": 1793944261, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "vipiin_guppta", "author_id": "63270966479", "id": "17936018913142618", "text": "Our collaboration will help your brand reach more students and increase brand awareness. Since our content is education-focu